WEBVTT

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.976
What would an A to Z system look like?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.096
I'm going to distinguish
between what I call

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.120
front half and back half.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.976
And let's call this red line,
I don't know, mission accomplished.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.976
(Laughter)

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.976
(Applause)

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.976
What we have extant right now,

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.976
at the beginning of this system, is the U.N.
Security Council as a grand jury.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.976
What can they do?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.000
They can indict your ass.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.976
They can debate it. They can
write it on a piece of paper.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.381
They can put it in an envelope
and mail it to you,